            <profile id="4982-ad7e-93f2-1f2b" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="15ea-5299-d0f5-5dbb" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, thrusting spear and large shield. May have darts or javelins (+1 pt). Two units of Regular Skutatoi may have light armour (+3 pts). Shieldwall. Combined Formation - up to a third of the models in any Skutatoi unit may be Skutatoi archers, who are placed in the rear ranks. Heraclian Skutatoi may be Drilled (+1 pt). Irregular Skutatoi count as Levies. Heraclian Regulars 8 pts Ld 7; Justinian Regulars 7 pts Ld 6 (Heraclian Regulars may not be chosen in Justinian armies). (Byzantium p.39)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="30de-bbda-8871-dcd0" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
