            <profile id="0c7a-422d-a5ce-9f50" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="15ea-5299-d0f5-5dbb" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon and javelins. May exchange javelins for bow (+1 pt), and have shield (+1 pt). Combined Formation - archers must combine with Skutatoi, they cannot be in their own units (built as a separate unit entry; combine them with a Skutatoi unit on the table). Heraclian Skutatoi archers may be Drilled (+1 pt). Irregular Skutatoi count as Levies. Heraclian Regulars 6 pts Ld 7; Justinian Regulars 5 pts Ld 6. (Byzantium p.39)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
