              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, throwing or thrusting spear and shield. Germans may have light armour (+2 pts) or heavy armour (+3 pts), and either take javelins (+1 pt), or exchange spear &amp; shield for kontos &amp; buckler (+1 pt). May dismount (-8 pts, reduce Movement to 4). Superior Germanic Cavalry. Justinian armies only. (Byzantium p.41)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
